Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:23.55,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It can't be damaged by spirit energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:24.42,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:33.68,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Magic doesn't work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.47,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And the exit's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.87,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,A boss room...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:43.41,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And one of the ones where you can't \Nescape unless you defeat the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:50.01,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Man... What horrible luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:55.78,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:01:00.45,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm an adventurer, which means I'll \Nfight to the end without giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:05.83,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't know if my sword will hold, but if \Nit's an undead, divinity should work on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:05.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:11.25,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,100)\c&H908A88&\3c&H000000&\pos(201.505,278.684)}Existential\NEvolution
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:08.84,Main - Top,Lorris,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.65,Main - Top,Lorris,0,0,0,,Oh, right! There was this huge skeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:17.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The most I can do is patch you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.15,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,No... thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.23,0:03:25.21,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,You defeated it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:26.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:30.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I-It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:33.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If it had a magic stone of this size,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:35.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,it must've been an incredibly \Npowerful monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.11,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:39.34,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:42.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can have it, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:45.05,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:48.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Not without condition, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:49.59,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:54.57,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I can't see how somebody like me could be \Nof use to a powerful adventurer like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:57.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This is what I look like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:01.81,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A monster got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:05.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't go into the shops, or the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:10.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want you to do that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:15.34,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Sure, even I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:18.49,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,But is that really all you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.85,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,The deal seems one-sided in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:23.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Then one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:30.89,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let me eat and drink at your \Nrestaurant whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:32.27,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,For free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:39.30,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Are you stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:44.76,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Eat all you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:48.53,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I won't let my restaurant \Ngo bankrupt this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:49.92,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I'll work extra hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.59,0:04:53.61,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:57.30,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.77,0:05:00.41,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:04.59,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:11.54,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:16.08,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,So he can't see the magic circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:20.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It should take you back\Nto where we came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.61,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:23.79,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,If you say it, I believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:34.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want to go on ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:35.52,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But it'll have to be another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:44.95,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,This is my restaurant, \Nthe Red Dragon Tavern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:48.24,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's cleaner than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:50.63,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Maybe the food's so bad it kills you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:54.03,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Honey, you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:54.75,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.46,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.51,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,We have to call a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.42,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Calm down, Isabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:04.56,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:07.04,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I got a little hurt, but he patched me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:10.53,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Oh, how silly of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:14.59,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,He saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:15.58,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Oh, also...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.68,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Just look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.82,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:23.21,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Amazing, huh? He gave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.06,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:30.33,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,If you get tricked again... we \Ndon't have anything left to pay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:33.78,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Isabelle, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:36.62,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,He may not look it, but \Nhe's actually a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:39.68,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,He heard about my debt \Nand decided to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:43.89,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Of course, not for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:46.66,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I'm going to be helping him from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:48.86,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Will you be doing something dangerous again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:50.92,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. Just errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:57.04,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,And I promised he can eat here for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:07:00.02,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,But that's barely anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:02.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:04.68,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:05.83,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:09.54,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I know I worried you, but it's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:14.66,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Oh, I never did introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:17.81,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I'm Lorris. Lorris Cariello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:19.27,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,And this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:20.62,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Isabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.85,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:27.16,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.85,0:07:31.41,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,You're leaving already, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:35.47,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,You saved my life. At \Nleast tell me your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:43.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can you promise you won't tell anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:44.58,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:48.40,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,I'll keep it a secret. And I'll \Nkeep calling you "mister."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:52.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:55.16,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:59.05,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Come for a meal any time you like! \NWe'll be happy to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.53,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's a shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:09.90,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If he was a liar...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:12.96,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Just a villain with no family...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:17.15,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That would've been so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.91,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'd rather test it on someone evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:29.31,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't ask his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:31.21,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's such a shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:37.49,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:42.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No... What am I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:48.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:55.32,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're a bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.97,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,How was the labyrinth? \NDid you see the dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:00.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:04.75,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Oh, where did you put the \Nletters I got from the empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.53,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I need to answer them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:08.92,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,or the old men are gonna come \Nand break down my door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:12.00,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.92,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Was there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.83,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You don't sound so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.57,0:09:18.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.98,0:09:21.28,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:23.24,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Oh? Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:29.25,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,R-Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:30.66,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:32.52,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.18,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,No, I guess an undead can't get drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:38.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:42.35,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:43.76,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:55.15,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,R-Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.26,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:05.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,D-Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:10.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt... are you still in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:11.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Good... you're still there, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.18,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.51,0:10:32.86,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:34.60,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,For now, sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.43,0:10:37.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll hear your apology when you wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:42.53,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If you're going to grab me like \Nthat, do it when you're sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:46.43,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You can devour me any time you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:56.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What was I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:58.38,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Are you awake, Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:01.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah. My head...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:06.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was in the labyrinth...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:10.28,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Do you feel like something \Nstrange is in control of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:12.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Or giving you strange impulses?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:18.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Very good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.55,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll accept your apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:26.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:28.61,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It was an unpleasant accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:29.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.37,0:11:31.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:34.41,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm more interested in \Nhow much you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:38.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I remember attacking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:45.74,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No... I met a man in the labyrinth, \Nand he looked delicious to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:47.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I started going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:52.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And you looked so delicious, \NI couldn't help myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:55.00,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I expected this, to a degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.39,0:11:56.87,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:57.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:00.88,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Ghouls prefer the flesh and blood of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:03.74,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,More importantly, is your body okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:07.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I almost never hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:09.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It seems okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.91,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:12.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But you took damage, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.39,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So rest quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:17.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I will too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.47,0:12:19.46,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:21.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:30.85,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'd just sold all my potions \Nto the magical pharmacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:31.83,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:35.06,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Once I get the ingredients in the \Nmorning, I'll make one right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:38.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let me take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:43.82,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You can use that much divinity?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:44.79,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:47.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I should be able to do basic healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:50.89,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I've never been healed by divinity before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:53.95,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It feels nice. It's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:56.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:00.01,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yeah, the pain's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:04.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,This is amazing. It's all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:05.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:18.41,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I guess I can't pretend to \Nbe damaged goods anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:20.91,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:24.66,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:32.66,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,At this point, you might be able \Nto pass it off as old wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:36.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What about my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:38.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The mask has changed form!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:41.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What, you didn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:45.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll need to hide this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:53.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That mask isn't just cursed, I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Is it responding to your desires?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.51,0:13:56.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.32,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:07.01,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I've heard of magical swords \Nwith wills of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:12.04,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If you can control it, \Nmaybe you can take it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.11,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:16.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Come off... Come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.21,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Can I try pulling on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:20.55,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:29.10,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, that's not entirely great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:33.84,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Though, your face is still like an undead's. \NYou'll need to hide it for a while anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.88,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:38.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll stay like this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:41.65,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Your words are a lot clearer now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's much easier to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:46.94,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Did I existential evolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.86,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I would assume so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:53.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I defeated a strong monster, yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:57.28,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Last time, I evolved right \Nafter I defeated the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:07.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was because you \Nfed on my blood and flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.81,0:15:10.59,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's not that strange an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:14.76,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're not a ghoul anymore. \NYou're closer to a ghast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A ghast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:19.49,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've almost never seen one... but \Nthey're servants of vampires, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:20.48,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:23.61,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They're weaker than even a lesser vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:25.87,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And that's what you look like right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:27.94,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But why a ghast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:30.14,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even among us academics,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:32.93,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,existential evolution is just like \Nthe origins of the labyrinth itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:34.97,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,A complete mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:36.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:41.07,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, would you like to hear my hypothesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:43.20,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes, please, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:46.69,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:50.08,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Of course, I would've told \Nyou even if you'd refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:51.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:57.08,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Now then, where to begin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:16:00.86,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I didn't see it, but you were \Na skeleton at first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:04.60,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was... interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:06.93,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And then you became a ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:07.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:13.20,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's strange that \Nyou'd go from a skeleton to a ghoul?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:19.21,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Existential evolution is when a monster \Ntransforms into a more powerful being.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:23.12,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, that's the current definition, \Nregardless of what the exact truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:24.12,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:27.79,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So is a ghoul the only monster \Nsuperior to a skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:32.85,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, there's a skeleton soldier, a skeleton \Nknight... there's a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:37.07,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There are reports of skeletons \Nbecoming ghouls, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:41.26,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But as for whether that's a coincidence, \Nor if there's some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:44.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,We know nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:48.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But there's one thing we can infer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:56.23,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The monster is evolving into \Nthe form it wishes to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:17:02.74,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You kept saying you wanted \Nto become more human, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:09.45,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But then couldn't I have become \Na vampire instead of a ghast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:13.23,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A vampire looks more human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:16.60,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's probably like the adventurer's guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:19.77,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You can't jump from Iron to Gold, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:22.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There must be conditions and \Naptitudes that you need to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:24.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.22,0:17:26.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Experiments using smaller monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:30.21,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,have shown they existential evolve into \Na form adapted to their environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:33.32,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,In a volcanic area, to a form \Nwith high fire affinity,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:36.83,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,near water, to a form with \Nhigh water affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:42.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's possible that this evolution was a \Npassive reaction to their environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:46.03,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But if it happened in response \Nto the monster's will...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:51.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There are some leaps of logic there, but it \Nseems to me like you have that potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:56.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Which means if I work hard enough, \NI might become a vampire someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:02.30,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And someday... go back to being human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:05.11,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The former I can say is a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:07.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The latter, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:08.82,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.81,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I imagine that any further \Nexistential evolutions
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:14.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,will involve more than \Njust defeating monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:22.27,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Just like how I became a ghast by \Ningesting your flesh and blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:25.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,there must be some condition \Nfor becoming a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.07,0:18:27.42,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:30.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's so much we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:34.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even what I just said is just a hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:35.75,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You could even call it a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:39.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's a long road ahead, either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.70,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'll help you as best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:44.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.56,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.49,0:18:53.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Now, let me start checking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:55.91,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Start by taking off your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:19:00.49,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm going to use a magic item to take \Npictures of every inch of your body for my records.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:02.69,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And let me cut off part of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.69,0:19:03.70,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,C-Cut off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.28,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yeah. I want to see if you feel pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:06.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,D-Dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:08.67,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I can prepare an anesthetic, \Nbut will it work on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:12.67,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Then let's test that and a \Nbunch of other medical stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:15.63,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,We need to test your \Nsleep and appetite, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:18.78,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Find out for me if you can \Neat normal food later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:21.50,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And if you're closer to a vampire now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:23.77,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, we can start our experiments tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.97,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You must be tired today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:33.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I do have a little bit of common \Nsense, you know. Once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:35.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.06,0:19:39.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's true. Once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:55.10,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I feel fine. Good, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.76,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That strange impulse from yesterday is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:04.62,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't go into the labyrinth \Nwith my sword like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:07.10,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Clope will be so mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:08.80,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:11.44,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.01,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Your... sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:19.84,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,You ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.12,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,The materials are useless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:24.30,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,I can't repair this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:26.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I imbued it with divinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:31.03,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,That would explain the damage, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:35.30,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,There are no enemies in the Labyrinth of the \NMoon's Reflection that call for divinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:37.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I met a giant skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:38.93,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,No way in hell did you—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:42.76,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,No, you wouldn't lie about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.76,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.98,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I found an unexplored area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:48.43,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Ren—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.15,0:20:51.84,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,No... {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:55.00,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Is that... true?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.90,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,An unexplored area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:02.11,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,So that explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:05.95,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,I wondered why you looked so \Nweird when you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:08.70,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,So, did you get to explore it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:10.09,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:14.62,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So I hate to ask, but I'd like that \Nsword I asked for as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:16.12,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,I assume so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:19.85,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,You can't let the others explore it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:24.64,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,But the sword you asked for isn't ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.97,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,So I'll lend you another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:29.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:30.56,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:32.48,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,I'll give you something a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:37.02,Main,Clope,0,0,0,,You're one of our best customers, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:41.02,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah, I should've known I wouldn't fool him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:43.72,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, he lent me a new sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:46.72,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get done in the labyrinth \Nand do another existential evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.51,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Hey, give me all those veggies. All of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.51,0:21:52.28,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Can you come down a little \Non the price of that meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:54.11,Main,Merchant,0,0,0,,I can't say no to Isabelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.11,0:21:56.00,Main,Merchant,0,0,0,,Okay, take the meat in the back, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.00,Main,Isabelle,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:22:00.13,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,The Red Dragon Tavern opens for lunch today!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.41,Main,Lorris,0,0,0,,Come and see us, everyone!
